WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Your knees are so weak

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,800
Since you love kneeling so much

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,240
Jian Tong, please perform here now

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,240
Let everyone see

5
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:14,340
How did the eldest daughter of the Jian family become Sister Xiu, who lost face?

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,740
The once proud Miss Jian no longer exists

7
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,140
You ruined my family

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,780
Erase my education

9
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,100
I already had nothing

10
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,380
I'm not even qualified to negotiate with you.

11
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:45,200
Is it really still the Jian Tong I know? Mr. Shen?

12
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:46,860
what are your orders

13
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:51,300
Do you know him, Mr. Shen?

14
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,860
Did Xiaotong offend you? Don't be angry.

15
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,300
I will teach him well

16
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:57,900
Who interviewed him?
